  "description": {
    "en": "Calm tile-matching solitaire: match pairs of free tiles to clear the board. Big, clear tiles with a large-tile mode, every deal can be cleared, free hints, undo and shuffle, a daily puzzle, and new layouts and tile themes as you go.",
